# Leadhub

Site-wide pixel in `Templates/default.twig` (pageview). Newsletter forms call `lhi('subscribe', { email, interests: ['newsletters'] })`.

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| Tracking ID | `bQVrGwsJSGSpLS5` (override with `LEADHUB_TRACKING_ID` in `.env`) |
| Interest list code | `newsletters` (case-sensitive) |
| Form partial | `Partials/newsletter-form.twig` |
| Surfaces | homepage `.home-newsletter`, `/newsletter` |

Tracking ID is public (client JS). Confirm list code under Leadhub → Odběratelské listy if subscribe does not appear in Audience.
